summary:
  The cover is a button, shows a hand and opens the larger view for any
  picture.

history:
  Twice the pixels of a 32-pixel logo is 64, and the cover on the page is
  at least 126. A view that shows the picture smaller than the page does is
  not offered: no button for the keyboard, no hand, no click. This mutant
  offers it for every picture.

target:
  package/contents/ui/CoverTouch.qml

find:
      readonly property bool largerOffered: art !== ""
          && CoverLogic.largerAdds(natural.width, natural.height, width, height, roomW, roomH, ratio)

replace:
      readonly property bool largerOffered: art !== ""
          || CoverLogic.largerAdds(natural.width, natural.height, width, height, roomW, roomH, ratio)

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_covertouch.qml::test_a_small_logo_is_not_offered_larger.
  Line-neutral.
